            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fresh feathers! Parrot 0.28.2</h3><ul><li>Missed someone? Right-click a line, This line is, New speaker, and name them.</li><li>On speakers, the call screen tells you when headphones would give a cleaner transcript.</li><li>Each kind of call gets its own report, with a scorecard for interviews.</li><li>A parrot in your menu bar shows the call time, and Join &amp; Record starts your next call.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.28.2">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
